note Item i weighs ws[i] and is worth vs[i]. maximumvalue is the largest total worth of items (each
note taken at most once) whose total weight is at most cap (cap at most 1000).
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/knapsack
om2
fn maximumvalue ws view ulong * vs view ulong * cap ulong to ulong
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
